{
    "title": "Home Makeover: ASMR Game",
    "description": "Help out a single mother with her baby by restoring their house furniture in the Home Makeover: ASMR Game. This relaxing simulation game combines the satisfaction of home renovation with the soothing sounds of ASMR.\r\n\r\nRelaxing Gameplay:\r\n\r\n- Carefully peel away worn wallpaper with a relaxing sound.\r\n- Immerse yourself in home renovation games.\r\n- Restore the old chair, roof pipes, and other home furniture with calming gameplay.\r\n- Fill cracks on a roof with soothing sound effects.\r\n- Enjoy a home makeover and make the mother happy with your house designing skills.\r\n\r\n\r\nHome Makeover - Features:\r\n\r\n- Fix the home interior like the roof, walls, and fireplace to help the mother and her baby.\r\n- Unlock new furniture items while restoring the current one.\r\n- Try different sofa styles and designs after restoring the furniture and home.\r\n- Enjoy the anti-stress and relaxing gameplay of ASMR home games.\r\n\r\nLet's dive into Home Makeover: ASMR Game is specially designed for those who enjoy home renovation with relaxing sounds, and virtually decorating a beautiful home.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Help out a single mother with her baby by restoring their house furniture in the Home Makeover: ASMR Game. This relaxing simulation game combines the satisfaction of home renovation with the soothing sounds of ASMR.<br><br>Relaxing Gameplay:<br><br>- Carefully peel away worn wallpaper with a relaxing sound.<br>- Immerse yourself in home renovation games.<br>- Restore the old chair, roof pipes, and other home furniture with calming gameplay.<br>- Fill cracks on a roof with soothing sound effects.<br>- Enjoy a home makeover and make the mother happy with your house designing skills.<br><br><br>Home Makeover - Features:<br><br>- Fix the home interior like the roof, walls, and fireplace to help the mother and her baby.<br>- Unlock new furniture items while restoring the current one.<br>- Try different sofa styles and designs after restoring the furniture and home.<br>- Enjoy the anti-stress and relaxing gameplay of ASMR home games.<br><br>Let&#39;s dive into Home Makeover: ASMR Game is specially designed for those who enjoy home renovation with relaxing sounds, and virtually decorating a beautiful home.",
